    <string name="hex_editor_desc_rom">• Ama-PIC agcina amagama angamabhithi angu-14/16 ngokulandelana kwe-Little-Endian:
   - I-Byte Ephansi (LSB): 0x%1$s (offset 2×N)
   - I-Byte Ephezulu (MSB): 0x%2$s (offset 2×N+1)
• Uhlela kanjani?: Faka igama eligcwele elinengqondo [MSB][LSB] (isib. 2805 = LSB 05, MSB 28).
• Uhlelo lokusebenza luhlela kabusha ngokuzenzakalelayo amabhayithi abe yi-Little-Endian ye-silicon nefayela le-HEX.</string>
    <string name="hex_editor_desc_eeprom">• Amaseli e-EEPROM anama-byte angamabhithi angu-8 ngalinye.
• Faka i-byte ye-hexadecimal enezinhlamvu ezi-2 ngokuqondile (ibanga: 00 kuya ku-FF).</string>
